{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039940/extras/f4659f26659d031ed384e6342a75f17e.avif?t=1764648068\" width=630 height=122 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039940/extras/51310148426ff530452d22df3e46180f.avif?t=1764648068\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039940/extras/a00a0050eb6fba4791b39256955e49ea.webp?t=1764648068\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In The Bar Souls, you will dive into a retro pixelated world beating inside an enigmatic and hostile digital universe. Here, you are not just any hero: you are your own health bar, whose essence is measured with every blow taken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The journey challenges you with intense battles against relentless bosses, puzzles that test both your wit and perseverance, and an environment where defeat is never the end but the beginning of a new chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each time you fall, you gain the opportunity to wield a different weapon, changing your combat style and adding a roguelike twist to the experience. This cycle of death and rebirth forces you to adapt, master unknown weapons, and learn from every mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although the main path is linear, The Bar Souls rewards exploration: at times you can return to previous stages to uncover hidden passages, solve clever puzzles, and reveal fragments of a subtle, cryptic story pulsing beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this journey, the key is not only combat skill but also perseverance. Those who insist on moving forward will discover that beyond the retro and challenging veil, secrets lie in wait to be revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039940/extras/a00a0050eb6fba4791b39256955e49ea.webp?t=1764648068\" width=616 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039940/extras/7cf099913a06eac1ad0e3f114598d9af.avif?t=1764648068\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039940/extras/08475269abf43d34dc337f5d14d79b4c.avif?t=1764648068\" width=630 height=122 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"One of the first","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039940/d88dacc9b890885c0a1459ff4329a3b47e3a1a47.jpg"},{"name":"Take this!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039940/b31e8a3b8266f9fa2fed36270c1d5aadb70a4e7a.jpg"},{"name":"Something green","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039940/654d238865f9148ac735ec9aba34697396e37869.jpg"},{"name":"Flowerpot","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039940/38ef9927f4d42bc0fd425a8b583afe21405d8f7f.jpg"},{"name":"That fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039940/e001dc2637b2f088052ba93f653ee936c1074237.jpg"},{"name":"It's dangerous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039940/7c57a2b11e39ee751a2c81e115703f85ad4c37ed.jpg"},{"name":"Let there be light","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4039940/33c3c46394561646b3fe7d79d39c382b8d5ea4b6.jpg"},{"name":"Rock Radio","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.co